      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Livingston_County%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Livingston County’s history is celebrated by the Livingston County Historical Society, which preserves artifacts from the area’s natural, industrial, and social past.",
